{"text": "MEMORANDUM.\n\nNovember 8, 1993\n\nTo: Ms. K. Augustyn NY = Mr. B. Inge Mr. T. O/Hanlon\nMr. G. Brooks Mr. B. McGee Mr! Al Sallez\nMr. Al Giacoio N\u00a5 = Mr. L. Mitchell Mr. H. Strayhorn\nMs. L. Giordano NY = Mr. M. McGlynn N\u00a5 Mr. K. Stutts\nMr. D. Harris Mr. D. Mellen Mr. W. Welsh\nMr. J. Harris Mr. G. Nauman * Mr. R. Young\n\nMr. D. Hicks\nFrom: Allen Preddy Ht\n\nSubject: \"50 Cent Off Promotion\" Style Brand Family\n\nAnnouncement,\nThe Greensboro operation is making arrangements to support the\nfollowing STYLE brand family 50 cent off pack insert promotion:\n\nUPC Brands 6M Cases Cigarettes\n* 23750 Style Lts TOO man 1,459 8,754,000\n* 23740 style Lts Mthl 100 mm 1,450 8,700,000\n* 23550 Style Lts Box 100 mm 726 4,356,000\n* 23570 Style Lts Mthl Box 100 mm 788 4,728,000\n* 23760 Style Slim Lts Box 100 mn 641 3,846,000\n* 23770 Style Slim Lts Mth] Box 100 mm 662 3,972,000\nTotal 5,726 34,356, 000\n\nAction Requested\nPlease acquire the appropriate wrapping materials and schedule the\nproduction for the listed brands. Wrapping materials should be\ndelivered on November 22, 1993.\n\nDate Cod\n\nAll 6M cases will be manufactured with a \"USE BY APRIL 94\" date\ncode. Product will NoT be placed into freezer storage.\n\nDeadline\n\nAll product must be in the appropriate distribution warehouse by\nDecember 20, 1993.\n\nQuestions or Problems\nPlease notify me at extension 6754 if there are any questions or\nproblems with the above information.\n\nxc: Mr. M, Bowes Mr. G. O/Neill Dr. A. Spears\nMr. T. Falvey Mr. R. Orcutt NY Mr. D. Tedder\nDr. T. Jones Mr. M. Orlowsky NY Mr. G. Telford NY\n\nMr. T. Moring\n\n4ELTS6ES",
